      "cover": "images/toys/p11.webp",
      "pages": [
        {"img":"images/toys/p01.webp","c":7,"r":7,"caption":"午夜的钟声一响，玩具们发现泰迪不见了。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p02.webp","c":7,"r":7,"caption":"小锡兵说：大家分头找！"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p03.webp","c":7,"r":8,"caption":"铁皮火车搜遍了每一条轨道。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p04.webp","c":7,"r":8,"caption":"洋娃娃摇摇头：整晚都没见过它。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p05.webp","c":7,"r":9,"caption":"床底下，找到了几缕棕色的毛。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p06.webp","c":7,"r":9,"caption":"花猫说，阁楼上好像有声音。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p07.webp","c":8,"r":10,"caption":"阁楼的黑暗里，有一双熟悉的眼睛。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p08.webp","c":8,"r":10,"caption":"原来，泰迪是自己藏起来的。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p09.webp","c":8,"r":11,"caption":"它小声说：我不想离开奶奶。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p10.webp","c":8,"r":11,"caption":"“傻孩子，你永远都是我的。”"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p11.webp","c":8,"r":12,"caption":"那晚，玩具店开了一场回家派对。"},
        {"img":"images/toys/p12.webp","c":9,"r":12,"caption":"第二天早上，一切如常，又不太一样了。"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "desert",
      "title": "沙海驼铃",
      "cover": "images/desert/p02.webp",
      "pages": [
        {"img":"images/desert/p01.webp","c":7,"r":7,"caption":"月牙村的水井干了，驼队带着全村的水出发。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p02.webp","c":7,"r":7,"caption":"沙丘一座连着一座，像永远走不到头。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p03.webp","c":7,"r":8,"caption":"沙暴来的时候，连天空都被吃掉了。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p04.webp","c":7,"r":8,"caption":"水，只剩下最后半袋了。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p05.webp","c":7,"r":9,"caption":"废墟里的这口老井，救了他们的命。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p06.webp","c":7,"r":9,"caption":"老骆驼说，迷路了就看天上的星星。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p07.webp","c":8,"r":10,"caption":"那不是绿洲，是沙漠撒的谎。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p08.webp","c":8,"r":10,"caption":"老骆驼把最后一口水，推到了它面前。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p09.webp","c":8,"r":11,"caption":"快看！那里有树！"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p10.webp","c":8,"r":11,"caption":"月牙村，终于等到水了。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p11.webp","c":8,"r":12,"caption":"那天夜里，沙漠下了一场雨。"},
        {"img":"images/desert/p12.webp","c":9,"r":12,"caption":"从此，小沙狐成了新的引路人。"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "deep",
      "title": "深海灯火",
      "cover": "images/deep/p07.webp",
      "pages": [
        {"img":"images/deep/p01.webp","c":7,"r":7,"caption":"海底的珊瑚村庄，被「灯之心」温暖地照亮着。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p02.webp","c":7,"r":7,"caption":"那一夜，灯之心突然熄灭了。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p03.webp","c":7,"r":8,"caption":"它带着母亲的护身珠，独自游向深处。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p04.webp","c":7,"r":9,"caption":"途中，它穿过了沉睡百年的沉船。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p05.webp","c":7,"r":8,"caption":"海沟深处，有什么东西正盯着它。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p06.webp","c":7,"r":7,"caption":"在最深最黑的地方，它几乎放弃了。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p07.webp","c":8,"r":10,"caption":"就在那时，一群水母亮起了。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p08.webp","c":8,"r":10,"caption":"传说中的火种，就在祭坛中央。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p09.webp","c":8,"r":11,"caption":"取走火种的代价，是献出最珍贵的东西。"},
        {"img":"images/deep/p10.webp","c":9,"r":12,"caption":"从此，整片海都记得那颗珠子的光。"}
      ]
    },
    {
